From 55a72a3fef50fbb083a07ceddad3fb74f444a8cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 09:13:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): skip strapi banners, quarantine invalid records,
 honest run status

Real ORD data (672 rows) contains 17 type=banner carousel items with empty
title/content. They are now excluded by an explicit parser rule and counted
as skipped instead of failing validation.

- records that fail validation go to quarantined_records with the raw
  snapshot key, are released when fixed and pruned when they disappear
- sources.last_success_at only moves on a complete run; partial/failed
  runs set last_attempt_at/last_run_status, /health reports degraded and
  MCP results carry an INGESTION_INCOMPLETE warning
- run/item summaries record quarantined and skipped counts

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FCgoUnzqQSfKjvqShB2hjh
